diff --git a/docs/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
index 3811070..3f9d28e 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Keep hierarchy nodes and relationships accurate.** Anonymous-class construction follows its concrete constructor, trait composition is reciprocal, and declaration navigation handles comments. Expanding a changed declaration requires a fresh selection; Composer dependency discovery honors its configured folder. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Keep call hierarchies faithful to execution.** Optional parameter constructors belong to their declared callable. Imports, stored callbacks and deferred metadata remain navigable references without becoming callers; known keyword constructors retain their source locations while ambiguous runtime targets stay unresolved. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Keep Blade caller types consistent.** Component-bound variables honor source PHPDoc, and cross-file view data inference stays independent of another file’s diagnostic scope. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
